  "translationRepairs": [
    ["s0052","idiomatic","He liked to say, \"Building a fortune takes the cunning of yiyin day or Lü Wang, the timing of Sun Wu's generals, and the ruthlessness of Shang Yang's code.","He liked to say, \"Building a fortune takes the cunning of Yi Yin or Lü Wang, the timing of Sun and Wu in using troops, and the ruthlessness of Shang Yang's code.","Focus unit 伊尹、呂尚之謀，孫、吳用兵 names Yi Yin and Lü Shang for schemes, then Sun and Wu as two strategists using troops; the prior English corruptly turns 伊尹 into \"yiyin day\" and collapses 孫、吳 into \"Sun Wu's generals\". The proposed idiomatic repair restores both names correctly without inventing content.","high","applied"],
    ["s0052","literal","Therefore he said: \"In managing my livelihood it is like the schemes of yiyin day and Lü Shang, Sun and Wu's use of troops, Shang Yang's carrying out of laws.","Therefore he said: \"In managing my livelihood it is like the schemes of Yi Yin and Lü Shang, Sun and Wu's use of troops, Shang Yang's carrying out of laws.","Focus unit 伊尹 is the personal name Yi Yin; \"yiyin day\" is a mistranslation of that name. The rest of the proposed literal line already matches 呂尚、孫、吳用兵、商鞅行法, so correcting only that name is accurate.","high","applied"]
  ],
